Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?ci:=20=E6=96=B0=E5=A2=9E=20lint=20job=EF=BC=88r?=
 =?UTF-8?q?uff=20check=EF=BC=89?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

三个 job：lint（ruff）/ test-sqlite / test-postgres。lint job 只装 ruff 而不装整个
requirements.txt——里面有 pgserver（自带 PostgreSQL 二进制，体积大），lint 用不上；
版本仍用 `grep -oE '^ruff==[0-9.]+' requirements.txt` 从 requirements.txt 取，
避免两处版本号漂移（实测取出 ruff==0.16.5）。

本地已验：YAML 可解析、jobs 为 lint/test-sqlite/test-postgres、
`ruff check .` → All checks passed!。但 v7 actions 与新 job 在 GitHub 上的实跑
仍需 push 后由 CI 确认。

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .github/workflows/ci.yml | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
index e7f1d3e..2c162a9 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
@@ -28,6 +28,27 @@ concurrency:
   cancel-in-progress: true
 
 jobs:
+  lint:
+    name: 静态检查（ruff）
+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
+    steps:
+      - uses: actions/checkout@v7
+
+      - uses: actions/setup-python@v7
+        with:
+          python-version: "3.11"
+          cache: pip
+
+      # 只装 ruff，不装整个 requirements.txt —— 里面有 pgserver（自带 PG 二进制，很大），
+      # lint 用不上。版本仍从 requirements.txt 取，避免两处版本号漂移。
+      - name: 安装 ruff
+        run: |
+          python -m pip install --upgrade pip
+          pip install "$(grep -oE '^ruff==[0-9.]+' requirements.txt)"
+
+      - name: ruff check
+        run: ruff check .
+
   test-sqlite:
     name: 测试（SQLite 后端）
     runs-on: ubuntu-latest
-- 
2.39.5

